でしてもいいです。ポーズは3人とも腰を曲げずにまっすぐな姿勢でお願いします)\n\nできれば3人とも恥ずかしがり屋の表情バージョンもお願いします\nhttps://imgur.com/a/WlVoAnX\n(これはしなくてもいいです。)\n\n両側にいる二人の体の方向は中間にいる人を向くようにしてください\n絵の視点は三人を正面から眺めている視点でお願いします。\nhttps://imgur.com/a/A2uJTxd\n\n三人の体形はにむちむち体型にしてください。\nhttps://imgur.com/a/4Qu7mmj\n(これはしなくてもいいです。)\n\n背景はなくてもいいです。\n先生の絵が素敵で膝の上とかお尻までは見たいです!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 422604, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "オガタ。", "screen_name": "ogt_illust", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950376867875475456/9Ak2OJXD.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2773170452/1763928508/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 783724, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "こうかわ りんは", "screen_name": "mofurinha9095", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1985566998596894721/RbC6FdDk.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1842823650/1713690979/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 1842173, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "Konoha@Skeb募集中", "screen_name": "Konoha217", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1857164000536272896/kFXhvh_s.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/787526590741688321/1718113250/1500x500",